    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No. 8 Latchford Green, a superb three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence situated within a mature and highly sought-after development in Clonee. Offering generously proportioned accommodation, this wonderful home is perfectly suited to first-time buyers, young families, and those seeking a convenient residential setting.\n \nThe accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway with guest WC, a spacious living room features an attractive fireplace, the open-plan kitchen/dining area is fitted with base and wall mounted cabinetry, double doors open to rear garden. Upstairs, three generously sized bedrooms all benefit from fitted wardrobes, the main bedroom features an en-suite shower room. A family bathroom and hot press complete the internal accommodation.\n \nOutside, the property enjoys a private rear garden laid in lawn with flower beds, a built-in decked area provides space for outdoor dining, entertaining guests, or simply relaxing during the warmer months. The gated side passage provides convenient access to the rear garden.\n \nThe location has an excellent range of local amenities within easy reach. Clonee and Ongar villages are both nearby, offering a variety of shops, cafés, schools, and everyday conveniences. Excellent public transport links are within walking distance, while the M3, M50, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, and Dublin Airport are all easily accessible, making commuting exceptionally convenient.\n \nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.58m x 1.03m\nWelcoming entrance hallway with laminate flooring, carpeted staircase, and guest WC.\n\nLiving Room - 5.01m x 3.72m\nSpacious front-facing reception room featuring an attractive fireplace. Fitted laminate flooring.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.69m x 4.86m\nFitted with a range of wall and floor-mounted units, integrated fridge, oven, dishwasher, electric hob with extractor fan, stainless steel sink unit, and double doors providing access to the rear garden.\n\nWC - 1.67m x 1.53m\nComprising of a WC, wash hand basin, and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.81m x 2.73m\nDouble bedroom overlooking the rear garden, featuring fitted wardrobes, carpet flooring, and an en-suite shower room.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.07m x 1.49m\nShower, WC and wash hand basin. Tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.02m x 2.61m\nDouble bedroom overlooking the front of the property with fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.11m x 2.15m\nFront-facing bedroom with fitted wardrobe and carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.07m x 1.92m\nComprising bath with shower attachment and glass shower screen, WC, and wash hand basin.\n\n"
      },
